cità, ma i suoi impulsi più inquietanti minacciano ogni equilibrio."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Manticore","overview":"Julián is a successful video-game designer whose life is plagued by a dark secret. But when Diana pops up in his life, the man will feel as though a chance at happiness is within his grasp."},{"language":"es-ES","overview":"Sigue a Julian, un exitoso diseñador de videojuegos torturado por un oscuro secreto. Cuando Diana aparezca en su vida, Julian comenzará a ver una oportunidad de ser feliz.  Según Vermut, \"Mantícora\" habita en el mismo universo de terror cotidiano que el resto de sus películas hasta la fecha. \"'Mantícora' habla de un verdadero monstruo, ese que vive entre nosotros, algo con lo que te puedes topar en el metro o en la cola de la panadería. Habla de la necesidad de un monstruo de amar y ser amado\". Vermut explicó y agregó: \"Es una historia sobre el amor y los monstruos en los tiempos modernos\"."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q0aBTr5powKFlD08cQ5FqKkC4VQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/c61whqxzO2RsZCOsOaf6Ao4eYVN.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":760158,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"es-ES","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zjjQksxvBFDkraifSGzft9j6MXo.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000}]},"es":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q0aBTr5powKFlD08cQ5FqKkC4VQ.jpg","previewUrl":"h